+// masked_select_forward
+// Semantics: torch.masked_select(input, mask) where mask broadcast to input shape.
+// Strides are arbitrary; input and mask are CUDA tensors.
+// Output is 1D, length = number of True in mask (in row-major broadcast traversal).
+// We implement stable selection via two-pass:
+//   1) count true elements in broadcast mask
+//   2) exclusive scan / prefix sum per block to determine output positions
+//   3) copy selected input values to output in order.
+// Host launcher is responsible for allocation and calling kernels.
+//------------------------------------------------------------------------------
